# kalkylark 1
# A monthly household budget: labels, values, @SUM and a $ format.
/GO N
/GC 11
/GF G
>A1:"Budget
>B1:"November
>A3:"Rent
>B3:/F$:9500
>A4:"Food
>B4:/F$:4200
>A5:"Transport
>B5:/F$:970
>A6:"Other
>B6:/F$:1500
>A8:"Total
>B8:/F$:@SUM(B3...B6)
>A9:"Per day
>B9:/F$:+B8/30
>A10:"Largest
>B10:/F$:@MAX(B3...B6)
